{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Uew1YsLHvY1792996247.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產黃埔第二分行資深分區營業經理袁顯岸表示，分行最新促成一宗紅磡站都會軒成交，單位為2座中層15室，實用面積496平方呎，採兩房一廁間隔，望西南開揚市景，原以980萬元放售，現累減52萬元，以928萬元易手，折合實用呎價18710元。</p><p><br/>中原地產袁顯岸指，新買家為外區客，鍾情站頂物業，有感屋苑位置優越，即睇即決定議價，遂拍板入市單位。據悉，原業主於2014年3月以580萬元購入物業，持貨12年，現轉手賬面可獲利348萬元離場，單位期內升值6成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:53.434302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.024879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:34.232803+00:00","content_hash":"c76197bb49ae2d9ec5c055a79e0ebbfd280b2c793726a436c2f087a59e0a389b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:53.434302+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}